#: userland/apps/openrc-controller/window.cpp:873
msgid ""
"Select services and use the toolbar or Service menu. Ctrl/Shift selects multiple services; column headers sort.\n"
"\n"
"Enabling changes runlevel membership; starting changes the current running state. Use the Configuration tab to edit conf.d or global rc.conf; saving makes a backup and detects external changes.\n"
"\n"
"Advanced actions support conditions, dry run, zap and custom service commands. Canceling may leave OpenRC in a transitional state; inspect status before using zap.\n"
"\n"
"The application never invokes shutdown, reboot, boot or sysinit runlevels. Logs are available when the corresponding system logger is configured."
msgstr ""
"选择服务后使用工具栏或“服务”菜单；按 Ctrl／Shift 可多选，单击列标题可排序。\n"
"\n"
"启用会改变运行级别成员，启动会改变当前运行状态。在“配置”页编辑 conf.d 或全局 rc.conf；保存会生成备份并检测外部修改冲突。\n"
"\n"
"高级操作支持条件执行、模拟执行、zap 和脚本自定义命令。取消操作可能留下过渡状态，使用 zap 前请检查实际状态。\n"
"\n"
"本程序不直接调用 shutdown、reboot、boot 或 sysinit 运行级别。相应日志需要先配置系统日志服务。"

#: userland/apps/openrc-controller/window.cpp:365
